# An X session on Dolly's display: the Xsdl server, twm managing the
# windows, and three of X's own clients in theirs: a clock, eyes that follow
# the pointer and a terminal with a shell, where imgui-x11 starts Dear ImGui's
# example in a window of its own.
FROM /v0.1.3/Dollyfile-system e39fd47a34303c190e010322b408d6b7bc75414aee1ba8934e1beff1f24ddd6f
INSTALL /v0.1.3/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xorg-server c9b4980365bacd61b5b7fa74acd36350f3f7fede9864a0b49687eb463436b3cf
INSTALL /v0.1.3/demos/x11/Dollyfile-twm 547a818c1193d9a7147e5ef490426592984797159e063067aa9e75d52c258f40
